1. Consume 3 selected skill runes and some zeny to make a new random class skill rune; 
2. Select skill runes of different quality, the chances of synthesizing skill runes of different quality are different with a chance of making a rune of higher quality. 
3. The best skill rune can be synthesized is at Level S; 
4. Skill runes marked as favorite can't be smelted.

