2. Runes with different names can't be smelted; 
3. Skill runes marked as favorite can't be smelted; 
4. When the runes are of the same attribute, the chance of getting a high value and generating an entry is higher.

1.符文分为属性符文和技能符文；\n2.技能符文分为13个职业类别，每个类别含S:
1. Runes are classified into Attribute Runes and Skill Runes; 
2. Skill Runes consist of 13 class types, each containing 3 quality levels of S, A, and B; 
3. Attribute Runes are divided into ATK Runes, DEF Runes, and Special Runes; 
4. Only skill runes of the current character class can be inlaid in the skill rune slot; 
5. Each skill rune is powered by 3 attribute runes of specific types. A skill rune becomes effective only when the 3 attribute runes all meet the requirement for inlaying; 
6. The 3 dots under the skill rune slot indicate the required attribute runes for activating the skill rune; 
Red -> ATK Rune 
Green -> DEF Rune 
Yellow -> Special Rune 
White -> Any rune 
7. Attribute runes and skill runes with the same name can't be inlaid; 
8. Upon change of job, runes will be removed and the original inlaying state will be recorded. Once switched back, the recorded inlaying state will be automatically restored. A changed attribute rune will be replaced by a rune of the same type at the highest level. If there's no rune of the same type, the spot will be left empty.

1. The Magnifying Glass can be used to evaluate unidentified runes; 
2. Evaluated skill runes can't be traded; 
3. Some skill runes bear special attributes, and different special attributes have different generation probabilities, which can be viewed in the rune preview tips on the evaluation screen. If an evaluated rune's attribute is gray, the skill rune hasn't generated the special attribute yet; 
4. Continuous Evaluation works on the selected rune for the number of the unidentified in possession. When you have less than 10 of the unidentified rune, Continuous Evaluation can evaluate all of the rune in possession.

