1.摆放在家园内的家具会生成评分，评分的值影响评分等级，评分等级的提升可为自己增:
1. Furniture placed in the Home generate points, which directly affect the score. Increase your score to gain extra buffs;
2. When placing two items of furniture of the same type, points will only be gained for the highest of the two. Placing duplicate furniture does not grant extra points;
3. Specific score-related buffs can be viewed in the Home Details interface.
4. If furniture is placed outside its restricted area, it will be considered invalid. The invalid points will be recorded in the Score interface. Invalid points are not included in the overall score, but will also not affect the placement of furniture.

