The three figures of the old Ryo clan all seemed to have a memory they were desperate to retrieve. This type of desperation created a space deep inside their hearts for exploration under the effect of their wish power: the Secret Realm of Shadow, where they waited helplessly at the entrance of the space, hoping to get some help from people passing by. The "keys" to accessing these memories are hidden in the wish power drenched with emotions. Retrieve the wish power and piece together the puzzle of lost memories one step at a time. Only by purifying the wish power at the Temple of Memory can they truly let go of their obsessions, as opposed to temporarily hiding them through forgetting, as they did before. n1. The Secret Realm of Shadow is split into several elemental areas based on different elemental types. Adventurers must clear all the monsters in the current area before entering the next elemental area;
2. After adventurers have cleared all the monsters in the current area, they can choose the elemental area that fits their team composition or needs and go there;
3. Adventurers will go through a total of five elemental areas in the Secret Realm of Shadow, with the last area guaranteed to spawn the MVP with the corresponding elemental attributes;
During the fight against the MVP, a special "Elemental Burst" mechanism will be triggered as the MVP's HP drops low. At this time, the MVP will gain a shield, which is extremely hard to break, while generating several Elemental Energy Bodies. Breaking each energy body will deal some damage to the MVP's shield. And if adventurers fail to break the shield within a limited time, the MVP will absorb the remaining Elemental Energy Body and burst out with high elemental damage. While the shield is active, the MVP will also trigger different Elemental Rampage effects depending on its attributes.
4. Monsters with elemental level will spawn in the Secret Realm of Shadow. Make good use of the elemental counter to defeat them;
5. Rewards of the Secret Realm of Shadow can be obtained 5 times a week, and each clear costs 60 minutes of Battle Duration. The first clear of each week costs no Battle Duration, and the reward count is refreshed at 5:00 every Monday;
6. Before the battle starts, team members can enter the instance by following. Once the captain starts the battle, team members can no longer enter the instance by following.
7. [Revival Rules]
The mysterious power in the Secret Realm of Shadow has restricted the "Death Blow Protection" effect from adventurers: It will only take effect once during the battle in each area; When adventurers fight against monsters inside the secret realm, resurrecting an adventurer consumes resurrection count. When the resurrection count runs out, adventurers cannot be resurrected during the battle; Resurrecting adventurers out of combat doesn't consume any resurrection count.

